6","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"162842","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54754","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"156688","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"402607","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]}]}]},"checkedAt":1793340534982,"status":"ok","value":[{"title":"Lunar Sickles","synopsis":"Fiends flood into the factory district ahead of the spider invasion. Despite Akira urging her to run, Touko stands her ground and joins the fight. But what toll will a real battle take on her? And can anyone stem the tide now?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9625060/screencap/65a4dcf1d0f3e.jpg"},{"title":"Roaring Thunder","synopsis":"Koushi struggles to load and operate the Lightning Cannon, but both the gods and the spiders have other ideas. Meanwhile, a chance encounter leads Touko to witness a startling scene.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10248799/screencap/65ad6a23b2455.jpg"},{"title":"The Great Tree","synopsis":"With the fighting continuing unabated, the treefolk from the forbidden quarter are drawn to the surface, where they encounter a familiar face.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10249469/screencap/65b0df4970018.jpg"},{"title":"Banked Fire","synopsis":"While each divine clan pursues a separate goal, visions of the Flickering Flame lead Touko and Koushi toward the palace. But who is she really, and can they trust her guidance?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10249470/screencap/65b7543054a35.jpg"},{"title":"Sea of Trees","synopsis":"While following secret tunnels toward the palace, Touko and Koushi suddenly find themselves in the middle of the dark forest. They still have a letter to deliver, but the divine clans won't make the journey easy.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10249471/screencap/65c720eb22d7b.jpg"},{"title":"The Divine Palace","synopsis":"Koushi finally reunites with Hinako. They set out for the palace, but their path brings them face to face with the last of the capital's treefolk. Meanwhile, Touko and Akira encounter a familiar face of their own.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10249472/screencap/65cdba8b92ff8.jpg"},{"title":"The Empty Girl","synopsis":"Takimi confronts Koushi on the palace steps. The medically minded god insists that only his medicine can save Hinako, but Koushi refuses to let his sister suffer any more experiments. As tensions mount, Kira appears—seeming not quite herself.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10249473/screencap/65d2c7609567a.jpg"},{"title":"Heavenly Beast","synopsis":"Yuoshichi is on the rampage, seeking revenge against the divine clans, but with the Flickering Flame now residing within his own daughter, what lengths will he go to in order to achieve his ultimate goal?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10249474/screencap/65dc64a91bf5b.jpg"},{"title":"Lady Goddess","synopsis":"A fallbeast suddenly descends on the divine palace, adding to the ongoing chaos. Touko instinctively knows that she must hunt it.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10249475/screencap/65e6e7f2843af.jpg"},{"title":"Lamplight","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10249476/screencap/65eeaea5e349c.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
